054B                          ENDIF      
054B                          IF   FAST   
                    FNUL:     EX   DE,HL   ; NUL: the end of the program
                              JP   EXIT   
                    FIGN:     EX   DE,HL   ; 01h-20h and DEL (and 80h-FFh unchecked): nothing
